            <h3>Initial Compliance Review</h3>
            <p>We collect high-level information about your organization: size, locations, systems, workforce, vendors, existing policies, compliance resources, and any known concerns. This is a conversation and a document request, not an on-site disruption.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="tl-body">
            <h3>Risk &amp; Gap Identification</h3>
            <p>We review your documentation and workflows to identify missing records, stale policies, access issues, vendor gaps, security concerns, and operational vulnerabilities.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="tl-body">
            <h3>Prioritized Compliance Roadmap</h3>
            <p>Findings are organized by urgency so leadership knows what to address first and what can be planned over time.</p>
            <div class="priority-row">
              <span class="status status-crit">Critical</span>
              <span class="status status-warn">High priority</span>
              <span class="status status-neutral">Moderate</span>
              <span class="status status-ok">Long-term improvement</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="tl-body">
            <h3>Implementation &amp; Remediation</h3>
            <p>We help put fixes in place: policies, training, documentation, workflows, vendor management, and incident procedures. Where a fix is technical, we coordinate with your IT or security provider.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="tl-body">
